sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as External Client
    participant Server as Llama Stack Server<br/>8321/TCP HTTP
    participant vLLM as vLLM Inference<br/>Provider
    participant CloudLLM as Cloud LLM Provider<br/>(Bedrock/WatsonX/Azure/<br/>VertexAI/OpenAI)
    participant TrustyAI as TrustyAI FMS<br/>Safety Provider
    participant PostgreSQL as PostgreSQL<br/>5432/TCP
    participant VectorDB as Vector DB<br/>(Milvus/PgVector/Qdrant/FAISS)
    participant EvalProvider as Eval Provider<br/>(LMEval/RAGAS/Garak)
    participant OTEL as OTLP Collector<br/>(Optional)

    Note over Client,Server: Flow 1: Inference Request
    Client->>Server: POST /v1/chat/completions<br/>HTTP :8321
    Server->>Server: Route to configured<br/>inference provider

    alt vLLM Provider (inline/remote)
        Server->>vLLM: Forward inference request<br/>HTTP/gRPC
        vLLM-->>Server: Inference response
    else Cloud Provider (remote)
        Server->>CloudLLM: Forward inference request<br/>HTTPS (provider credentials)
        CloudLLM-->>Server: Inference response
    end

    Note over Server,TrustyAI: Flow 2: Safety Guardrails (Optional)
    Server->>TrustyAI: Content safety evaluation<br/>HTTP
    TrustyAI-->>Server: Safety verdict<br/>(pass/block)

    Note over Server,PostgreSQL: Flow 3: State Persistence
    Server->>PostgreSQL: Store agent state, inference records,<br/>file metadata, conversations<br/>TCP :5432 (kv_postgres + sql_postgres)
    PostgreSQL-->>Server: Acknowledgement

    Note over Server,VectorDB: Flow 4: Vector Storage
    Server->>VectorDB: Store/query embeddings<br/>(inline FAISS or remote Milvus/PgVector/Qdrant)
    VectorDB-->>Server: Vector search results

    Note over Server,EvalProvider: Flow 5: Evaluation Workloads
    Server->>EvalProvider: Dispatch evaluation<br/>(LMEval/RAGAS/Garak)
    EvalProvider-->>Server: Evaluation results

    Server-->>Client: JSON Response

    Note over Server,OTEL: Flow 6: Telemetry (Optional)
    opt OTEL_SERVICE_NAME is set
        Server->>OTEL: Export traces + metrics<br/>OTLP protocol
    end
